      "value": "@{5e44a1bd0c91c2477a8b8acb|full_name}: nah i dont record all the time and so far i only had it appear 3 times in the last weeks. but i will try to record it the next time. basically i had a lexichi with disabled objects in unity and all bodyparts and even some custom objects i originally disabled were all morphed together in the small avatar preview. changing the preview to a different avi and then the same one fixed it though. only appeared after opening the preview once after starting vrc. the first times i didnt even notice the bugged stuff was all the disabled objects so i just thought it was a random vrc bug and the parts werent related to the actual avatar and i didnt care much more.",
